00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:58.370
Aku punya susu.

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:13.050
Oh.

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:26.610
Dia tertawa!

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:28.820
Benar!

00:07:29.940 --> 00:07:32.570
Tiba-tiba dia terasa lebih berat.

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:33.870
Itu tidak mungkin!

00:07:50.880 --> 00:07:51.800
